atbread/cake"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"instrumental suffix (with)"}],"gloss":"with flatbreads"},{"surface":"கொழு","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"koḻu","gloss":"fat/rich"}],"gloss":"rich"},{"surface":"நிணம்","parts":[{"text":"நிணம்","lemma":"niṇam","gloss":"meat fat"}],"gloss":"fat"},{"surface":"பெருப்ப","parts":[{"text":"பெரு","lemma":"peru","gloss":"abound/increase"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"pa","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to abound"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வறத்தல்","parts":[{"text":"வற","lemma":"vaṟa","gloss":"dry up"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"tal","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"drying up/drought"},{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"kālai","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"time"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"āyiṉ","gloss":"if"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even/although"}],"gloss":"even if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புரத்தல்","parts":[{"text":"புர","lemma":"pura","gloss":"protect/nourish"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"tal","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"protecting"},{"surface":"வல்லன்","parts":[{"text":"வல்","lemma":"val","gloss":"capable/strong"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he is capable"},{"surface":"வாழ்க","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்","lemma":"vāḻ","gloss":"live"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"may live long"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"avaṉ","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"தாளே","parts":[{"text":"தாள்","lemma":"tāḷ","gloss":"feet/effort"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"feet"}]}],"literal":"On one side a clay drum hanging, on one side / a small drum with a hollow pipe inside hanging, carrying them, / 'Who will turn upright our upturned eating vessel?' thus / sitting at the edge of the desert path, O songstress with few bangles! / If you go, he is not far away, / the dark smoke rising from burning the enemy's border, / which young male elephants wear like mist surrounding a mountain, / he is in that enemy land, Añci of many spears. / Without any gap in time, the eating vessel never drying, / with soft ghee-smeared flatbreads and rich fat abounding, / even in times of severe drought, / he is capable of protecting. May his feet live long!","translation":"O songstress of few bangles, who sat at the edge of the desert path, carrying your instruments—a large clay drum hanging on one side, and a small hollow-piped drum hanging on the other—wondering, 'Who will turn upright our upturned begging bowls?' If you go to him, he is not far away. He is right there in the enemy's territory, Añci of many spears, where the dark smoke rising from the burning battlefronts wraps around young male elephants like mist surrounding a mountain. Even in times of severe drought, he is capable of nourishing everyone, keeping their eating vessels never dry, filled with soft ghee-smeared flatbreads and rich, abundant fat. May his feet live long!","modern":"ஒரு பக்கத்தில் பெரிய களிமண் பானை-முழவும், மற்றொரு பக்கத்தில் துளையுள்ள சிறிய முழவும் தொங்கும்படித் தூக்கிக்கொண்டு, 'கவிழ்ந்து கிடக்கும் நம் உணவுக் கலத்தை நிமிர்த்தி வைப்பவர் யார்?' என்று பாலைநிலத்தின் எல்லையில் அமர்ந்திருந்த சில வளையல்களை அணிந்த விறலியே! நீ அவனிடம் சென்றால் அவன் தொலைவில் இல்லை. பகைவரின் எல்லையைச் சுட்டெரிப்பதால் எழும் கரிய புகை, மலையைச் சூழும் மேகத்தைப் போல இளைய ஆண் யானைகளின் மேல் படியும் பகைப்புலத்தில் இருக்கிறான் பல வேல்களைக் கொண்ட அஞ்சி. வறட்சிக் காலத்திலும் கூட, இடைவெளியின்றி எப்போதும் காயாத உணவுக் கலத்தில், நெய் மெழுகிய மென்மையான அடைகளுடனும் கொழுத்த இறைச்சிக் கொழுப்புடனும் உணவளித்துக் காக்க வல்லவன் அவன். அவனுடைய அடிகள் வாழ்க!","explanation":"The poet Avvaiyār addresses a traveling songstress (viṟali) who is sitting dejectedly at the edge of a harsh desert path. The songstress carries her musical instruments, a large clay drum and a small hollow-piped drum, and wonders who will fill her empty, upturned begging bowl. Avvaiyār reassures her that the generous chieftain, Adhiyamāṉ Neṭumāṉ Añci, is not far away but is currently fighting in the enemy's territory. The poet describes the battlefield where the dark smoke from burning enemy lands wraps around young war elephants like mountain mist. Even during severe droughts, Añci is capable of nourishing everyone with rich, ghee-smeared flatbreads and abundant fat, keeping their bowls never dry. This contrast between the dry desert and the rich feast highlights the chieftain's immense generosity and protective nature.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.56],[0.56,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,2.3],[2.3,3.07],[3.07,3.72],[3.72,4.24],[4.24,4.75],[4.75,5.4],[5.4,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.43],[6.57,7.0],[7.0,8.0],[8.0,8.6],[8.6,8.8],[8.8,9.1],[9.1,9.55],[9.55,10.0],[10.0,10.4],[10.4,10.9],[10.9,12.3],[12.3,12.8],[12.8,13.25],[13.25,13.7],[13.7,14.9],[14.9,15.1],[15.1,15.3],[15.3,15.64],[15.64,16.1],[16.1,16.37],[16.37,16.63],[16.63,16.9],[16.9,17.46],[17.46,18.3],[19.32,19.92],[19.92,20.22],[20.22,20.42],[20.42,20.72],[20.72,21.12],[21.12,21.73],[21.73,22.22],[22.22,22.84],[22.84,23.33],[23.33,23.94],[23.94,24.19],[24.32,24.92],[24.92,25.48],[25.48,25.92],[25.92,26.32],[26.32,26.72],[26.72,27.02]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,2.8],[2.95,3.1],[3.1,3.7],[3.7,4.18],[4.4,4.9],[4.9,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,7.14],[7.14,7.42],[7.42,7.7],[7.7,8.9],[8.9,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,10.65],[10.65,11.2],[11.2,11.8],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,13.15],[13.15,14.0],[14.0,14.6],[14.6,15.1],[15.1,15.74],[15.74,16.38],[16.38,16.7],[16.7,17.02],[17.02,17.45],[17.45,18.1],[18.1,18.8],[18.8,19.5],[19.5,19.8],[19.8,20.72],[20.72,21.64],[21.64,21.94],[21.94,22.14],[22.14,22.54],[22.54,22.94],[22.94,24.24],[24.31,24.64],[24.64,25.25],[25.25,25.74],[25.74,26.34],[26.34,26.94],[27.01,27.44],[27.44,27.94],[27.94,28.34],[28.34,28.74],[28.74,29.04],[29.04,29.34]]},"sync":[[["ஒருதலை","one side"]],[["பதலை","clay drum"]],[["தூங்க","to hang"]],[["ஒருதலை","one side"]],[["தூம்பு","hollow tube"],["அக","inside"],["சிறுமுழா","small drum"]],[["சிறுமுழா","s